sangati rati

  "bhava-sthalam-sthita"
  "kama-phala darshana-janya thaalam-siddha"
  "sthayibhava-swarupa vriddhi-abheda samsarga-prakaasha-yukta"
  "mithuna-purva mithuna-yukta mithuna-paschat"
  "prema-samsarga-swarupa ananda-phala kshaya-rahita"
  "dampati-sthita tvam-pratibodha shringar-janya"

done
